.PS
# Half-wave rectifier with a reservoir capacitor: 10 V 60 Hz sine,
# load R1 || C1 (tau = 100 ms >> 16.7 ms period).
spice = 1
TL: (0,1.5); M: (1.75,1.5); TR: (3,1.5); BL: (0,0); MB: (1.75,0); BR: (3,0)
V1: acsource(TL, BL, SIN(0 10 60))
D1: diode(TL, M, DMOD)
C1: capacitor(M, MB, 100u)
R1: resistor(TR, BR, 1k)
line from M to TR
line from BL to BR
ground((0.9,0))
Vout: node(M)
dot at M; dot at MB
"out" above at M + (0,0.05)
.model DMOD D(IS=1e-14 RS=0.5)
.tran 0.1m 50m
.PE
